TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 349696598}
  m_Text: 'What is the fault in this scene?


    a. DAP meter is displaying too
    low dose area product values

    b. DAP meter is displaying too high dose area
    product values

    c. DAP meter is on cumulative setting

    d. Dose is too
    high/low but this is due to another fault

    e. Light beam is not aligned to
    the x-ray field

    f. Nothing, the system is working within tolerance'
